{"version":1,"content":"<p>無綫電視（TVB）年度盛事《萬千星輝賀台慶》盛大舉行，紅地氈上蕭正楠與陳自瑤結伴到場，陳自瑤晚裝上胸前一個蝴蝶點綴，相當搶眼。</p><p>而在《玫瑰戰爭》中掌摑陳自瑤的傅嘉莉，則一以襲紫色晚裝亮相，散發魅力。</p><p>&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-19T11:36:31.259387+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":110,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-19T09:25:14+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-19T11:29:43.199602+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-19T11:29:43.199602+00:00","content_hash":"9e8863692e657b3f012dc7d2e4f5414c1d092f83f813f9fc5badde90a3f5092d","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}